---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy notice | Prodory" description="How Prodory uses the details you send through this website." path="/legal/privacy/">
  <article class="prose-like mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14">
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-sm text-muted"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy notice</nav>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy notice</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 rounded-lg bg-card p-3 text-sm text-muted"><strong>Draft.</strong> This notice must be reviewed by counsel before it is relied on. Do not treat it as final.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold">What we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">When you send an enquiry we collect your name, work email, company, phone number (if you give it), the area of interest, your requirement and the page you came from.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold">Why we use it</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">To respond to the enquiry you made, on the basis of your consent to be contacted about it.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold">Marketing</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">We send technical updates only to people who tick the marketing box. Those contacts are also stored in our marketing automation system, Mautic. You can withdraw consent at any time.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold">Where it is stored</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Enquiries are recorded as leads in our customer relationship system (crm.aoplus.in). Marketing contacts are stored in Mautic. Both are operated by AO Plus Solutions Pvt Ltd.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold">Your rights</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">You may ask what we hold about you, ask us to correct or delete it, or withdraw consent. Write to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
